1658 0 obj
  << /ActualText (\042 Current on\055chain state\056 The latest supplied state is reserveVersion 7\054 totalSupply 456\054500\054000 CDX\054 collateralRatio 200\05600\045 \05020\054000 bps\051\054 availableReserve EUR 456\054500\054000\054 lastSnapshotAt 18 August 2026 at 18\07226 UTC\054 and reserveStatus\075false\056 The reported total reserve amount remains EUR 913\054000\054000\056\n\n\042 Historical evidence\056 Version\0554 reserve evidence\054 Chainlink relay transactions\054 Safe execution records\054 hashes and earlier 228\054250\054000 CDX \057 400\045 values should be retained only as timestamped historical evidence and must not be labelled as the current state\056\n\n\042 Reserve source wording\056 The project evidence describes an authenticated Bank API workflow\056 The internal service reference \047m1\055corebanking\047 is an application\057service name and is not evidence of direct access to a bank\047s internal core\055banking platform\056\n\n\042 External banking claims\056 This smart\055contract review does not independently confirm any bank balance\054 SWIFT message\054 custodian statement\054 bank guarantee\054 or external auditor attestation\056 Those matters require separate authentic third\055party evidence\056\n\n\042 Chainlink publication\056 The adapter\057request\055manager flow should be tested for caller authorization\054 request replay\054 malformed payloads\054 duplicate request IDs\054 stale reserve versions\054 signature mismatch\054 and failed forwarding into ReserveOracleV1\056\n\n\042 Reserve freshness\056 reserveStatus\075false at the supplied cut\055off should be interpreted according to the contract\047s freshness logic\056 The final auditor should reproduce the exact read at a documented block and determine whether the false state is an expected staleness flag or indicates another condition\056\n\n\042 Safe governance\056 The Safe address is 0xA86FC207De7EDb198a53C7cca179d75Bbeff5C28 with a reported 3\055of\0555 threshold\056 Auditor testing should confirm owner set\054 threshold\054 upgrade authority\054 administrative role grants\054 and representative executed governance transactions\056\n\n\042 Evidence integrity\056 Final publication should identify the audited source commit\054 compiler\057settings\054 deployment addresses\054 test suite results\054 static\055analysis output\054 and report hash\056 Public PDFs and website values should be reconciled to the same on\055chain cut\055off\056)
     /K [ 1 ]
     /P 1659 0 R
     /Pg 1453 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
